  unitName: Emilia
  unitId: 40122
  unitNumber: 162
  description: A dual-wielding general mentioned in the records of the ruined Atharva
    Republic. She distinguished herself in battle by using a technique she developed
    herself. Minstrels of her day sang of her climb to the rank of general. Popular
    with the people, songs said she was "as furious as thunder, fighting as though
    she were dancing." This earned her the title, "Thunder Dancer."
  summonDesc: My name is Emilia, but I'm<br>also known as the Thunder Dancer!<br>Bow
    before me, Summoner!
  fusionDesc: No one can defend against<br>my shining dual blades!
